===Etymology===
{{suffix|steam|punk|lang=en}}, by analogy to {{m|en|cyberpunk}}, coined by science-fiction writer [[w:K. W. Jeter|Kevin Wayne Jeter]] (born 1950) in a 1987 letter to the magazine ''[[w:Locus (magazine)|Locus]]'' in response to a review of his book ''[[w:Infernal Devices (K. W. Jeter novel)|Infernal Devices]]'' published the same year (see the quotation below).

